{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:50 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"元朗萬芊24小時內上樓書 部署推洋房招標\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/070f7704d8e8bf52deb47b41ad6a0b94/2026-10/KF_ANQI_-_2026-10-22T171105_319.png\"/>\n<p>長實發展的元朗萬芊，預告將於24小時內公布樓書，下周開放展銷廳予指定人士參觀，首批將招標推洋房應市。</p>\n<h2>不乏2房及3房洋房戶查詢</h2>\n<p>長實營業部副首席經理楊桂玲指出，項目自上周公布命名後，市場反應熱烈，當中不乏2房及3房洋房戶查詢，有見及此，部署將於24小時內公布樓書，最快下周開放展銷廳予指定人士參觀，首批將率先以招標形式推售洋房。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9e9b17f3e9dea4dcd729d4e1afa0d2d/2026-10/Photo_1_6.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94aeb936d9256f0db3c33abccfa2c32d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_17_14_32.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c099da2f616fcfd8bffd4ccf4cd3d106/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_15_47_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"長實元朗錦泰路項目萬芊（Montage）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df4bdefc1cf91c58d00f05880c8a1461/2026-10/PB260712WA05.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d0cc5fc3874a061b366ae39bf266120/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_15_47_45.jpeg\"/>\n<p>長實高級助理營業經理劉佩珊指出，項目會所名為「Club Montage」，會所連園林面積逾4萬方呎，擁四大主題設計，設逾20項多元設施，包括人寵共融空間、健身室、戶外健身空間及宴會廳等。</p>\n<p>相關文章：元朗萬芊最快周內上樓書 先推洋房招標</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T10:15:05.237045+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:54:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T10:38:00.018619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T10:10:41.333140+00:00","content_hash":"bf1db2f1c6454f9942d4219306f64f8aabddb2fb4065cee056fd01b9c0f2dbd1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}